* Reference: tunable SiGe HBT CTLE for a 28 Gb/s NRZ receiver front end, IHP SG13G2, 3.3 V (non-inverting:
*   voutp follows vinp).
* Input: DC-coupled. 50 ohm termination per leg to vocm sets the input common mode (the link's AC-coupling
*   capacitors are off-die); the pins drive the HBT bases directly.
* Gain stage: npn13G2 differential pair (Nx=8, about 6.5 mA per side) with per-side tails from iref: a wide lv NMOS
*   mirror (low overdrive) under a lv NMOS cascode biased by a diode-plus-resistor replica, so both stay saturated
*   down to 2.97 V at 0 C and the tail current does not move with temperature.
* Gain code: thermometer-coded emitter-degeneration resistor bank (hv NMOS switches at the bank's differential
*   virtual ground) across a 345 ohm base resistor; it sets the 1 MHz gain through the load/degeneration ratio.
* Peak code: emitter capacitance in three thermometer steps decoded by hv CMOS gates: two differential MOS
*   varactors (sg13_hv_svaricap, well low = high capacitance) for the first two steps and a 170 fF pair of
*   capacitors switched by an hv NMOS at the differential virtual ground for the third (its off state adds less
*   capacitance than a varactor would, which keeps code 00 low).
* Load: 45 ohm plus a 0.15 nH shunt-peaking inductor to an internal rail, and a 0.2 nH series inductor from each
*   collector to the opposite-polarity output pin; a CMFB amplifier drives the hv PMOS that sets the rail so the
*   output common mode tracks vocm.
.subckt ctle_28g vss vdd iref vocm vinp vinn gain_b0 gain_b1 peak_b0 peak_b1 voutp voutn
XREF iref iref vss vss sg13_lv_nmos w=6u l=0.5u ng=1
XTP tp iref vss vss sg13_lv_nmos w=360u l=0.5u ng=36
XTCP ep vcg tp vss sg13_lv_nmos w=80u l=0.13u ng=16
XTN tn iref vss vss sg13_lv_nmos w=360u l=0.5u ng=36
XTCN en vcg tn vss sg13_lv_nmos w=80u l=0.13u ng=16
XBN xbn iref vss vss sg13_lv_nmos w=6u l=0.5u ng=1
XBC pbd vocm xbn vss sg13_hv_nmos w=4u l=0.45u ng=1
XBPD pbd pbd vdd vdd sg13_hv_pmos w=10u l=0.5u ng=2
XBPC vcg pbd vdd vdd sg13_hv_pmos w=10u l=0.5u ng=2
XCREP vcg vcg vcs vss sg13_lv_nmos w=2u l=0.13u ng=1
RCB vcs vss 3.5k
CCG vcg vss 10p
RTP vinp vocm 50
RTN vinn vocm 50
XQP cp vinp ep vss npn13G2 Nx=8
XQN cn vinn en vss npn13G2 Nx=8
LPP vddi xp 0.15n
RLP xp cp 45
LOP cp voutn 0.2n
LPN vddi xn 0.15n
RLN xn cn 45
LON cn voutp 0.2n
RS0 ep en 345
RG1A ep g1a 643
XG1A g1a gain_b1 g1b vss sg13_hv_nmos w=20u l=0.45u ng=4
XG1B g1a gain_b0 g1b vss sg13_hv_nmos w=20u l=0.45u ng=4
RG1B g1b en 643
RG2A ep g2a 491
XG2 g2a gain_b1 g2b vss sg13_hv_nmos w=20u l=0.45u ng=4
RG2B g2b en 491
RG3A ep g3a 386
XG3A g3a gain_b1 g3m vss sg13_hv_nmos w=40u l=0.45u ng=8
XG3B g3m gain_b0 g3b vss sg13_hv_nmos w=40u l=0.45u ng=8
RG3M g3m vss 1meg
RG3B g3b en 386
XN1PA n1 peak_b0 vdd vdd sg13_hv_pmos w=2u l=0.5u ng=1
XN1PB w1 peak_b1 n1 vdd sg13_hv_pmos w=2u l=0.5u ng=1
RN1 n1 vdd 1meg
XN1NA w1 peak_b0 vss vss sg13_hv_nmos w=1u l=0.5u ng=1
XN1NB w1 peak_b1 vss vss sg13_hv_nmos w=1u l=0.5u ng=1
XI2P w2 peak_b1 vdd vdd sg13_hv_pmos w=2u l=0.5u ng=1
XI2N w2 peak_b1 vss vss sg13_hv_nmos w=1u l=0.5u ng=1
XN3PA w3 peak_b0 vdd vdd sg13_hv_pmos w=2u l=0.5u ng=1
XN3PB w3 peak_b1 vdd vdd sg13_hv_pmos w=2u l=0.5u ng=1
XN3NA w3 peak_b0 n3 vss sg13_hv_nmos w=1u l=0.5u ng=1
XN3NB n3 peak_b1 vss vss sg13_hv_nmos w=1u l=0.5u ng=1
RN3 n3 vss 1meg
RW1 w1 w1f 20k
RW2 w2 w2f 20k
CW1 w1f vss 1p
CW2 w2f vss 1p
XV1 ep w1f en vss sg13_hv_svaricap w=9.74u l=0.8u nx=3
XV2 ep w2f en vss sg13_hv_svaricap w=9.74u l=0.7u nx=5
XA3P a3 w3 vdd vdd sg13_hv_pmos w=2u l=0.5u ng=1
XA3N a3 w3 vss vss sg13_hv_nmos w=1u l=0.5u ng=1
CT3P ep t3p 170f
XST3 t3p a3 t3n vss sg13_hv_nmos w=80u l=0.45u ng=16
CT3N t3n en 170f
RT3P t3p vss 20k
RT3N t3n vss 20k
RCP voutp cms 10k
RCN voutn cms 10k
XE1 ea1 cms et vss sg13_hv_nmos w=10u l=0.5u ng=2
XE2 ea2 vocm et vss sg13_hv_nmos w=10u l=0.5u ng=2
XEP1 ea1 ea1 vdd vdd sg13_hv_pmos w=10u l=0.5u ng=2
XEP2 ea2 ea1 vdd vdd sg13_hv_pmos w=10u l=0.5u ng=2
XET et iref vss vss sg13_lv_nmos w=12u l=0.5u ng=2
CCMP ea2 vdd 2p
XPASS vddi ea2 vdd vdd sg13_hv_pmos w=200u l=0.4u ng=40 m=4
CVDDI vddi vss 20p
.ends ctle_28g
